      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grand_Prairie%2C_Texas",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "During World War I, Grand Prairie became a hub for defense and aviation, a legacy that still echoes in its growing aerospace industry today.",
